# ESP32 Smart Locker
user smart-locker

topic read smart-locker/session/action
topic read smart-locker/session/action/locker/+

topic write smart-locker/session/event
topic write smart-locker/session/event/locker/+
topic write smart-locker/locker/+/event


# Smart Locker Backend
user smart-locker-backend

topic write smart-locker/session/action
topic write smart-locker/session/action/locker/+

topic read smart-locker/session/event
topic read smart-locker/session/event/locker/+
topic read smart-locker/locker/+/event